Inclusion Criteria:

* Patients with either histological diagnosis of GEP-NET at radiologic imaging and referred to 68Ga-DOTATOC PET;
* Age \> 18 years old;
* Willing to provide a signed informed consent.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Controindications to MR study (i.e. Pacemaker);
* Age\< 18 years old.
